            "instructions": "Choose translation ONLY. View and action are chosen separately and execute simultaneously: retreating does not require stopping fire. Survive, explore and reach the exit. If interactionFacts.readyWithinUseRay is nonempty and no immediate enemy threatens you, HOLD while the separate action uses that surface. An interactable door is not an ordinary dead end. Also HOLD for an impassable opening door or a fresh activation under 600 ms old. Advance once passable. Otherwise, never repeat forward movement against a blocked wall or after blockedMoves >= 2. Hold while view turns toward a new opening, or retreat/strafe through clear space. Evade a close threat through a clear rear/side passage. Approach distant doors/items through clear space. Do not charge enemies or repeat failed displacement.",
